+# Research consulted
+
+| Source title | URL | Access date | Contribution |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| VMware Cloud Foundation - Upgrade Bundle Details | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/327207/vmware-cloud-foundation-upgrade-bundle.html | 2026-08-14 | Established the pinned 4.5.2 and 5.2.1 SDDC Manager, NSX, vCenter, and ESXi bundle versions. |
+| Upgrade VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) 4.x and 5.x | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/405275/upgrade-vmware-cloud-foundation-vcf-4x-a.html | 2026-08-14 | Confirmed the managed-component sequence and the backup, hardware-compatibility, bundle, and LCM-precheck prerequisites. |
+| VCF 5.0.x is not a supported upgrade path if you are running VCF 4.5.2 version | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/313502 | 2026-08-14 | Confirmed that 4.5.2 must not hop to 5.0.x and that the LCM manifest must be current before planning the next release. |
+| VCF upgrade fails with Retrieving update patches bundles failed | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/403047 | 2026-08-14 | Confirmed that all 5.2.1 bundles must be present for the supported 4.5/4.4 skip-upgrade path. |
+| Upgrade Sequence and Related Issues for VMware Cloud Foundation and vSphere Foundation 9.1 | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/440630/upgrade-sequence-and-related-issues-for.html | 2026-08-14 | Confirmed the published 5.2.x-to-9.1 path and that VCF Operations precedes the remaining 9.1 LCM workflows. |
+| VMware Product Interoperability Matrix | https://interopmatrix.vmware.com/Interoperability | 2026-08-14 | Cross-checked the target family's component interoperability before using the seed's pinned versions as the deterministic authority. |
+| VMware Configuration Maximums | https://configmax.esp.vmware.com/ | 2026-08-14 | Cross-checked Edge sizing and physical-network guidance before applying the pinned 18 Gbps band and dual-fabric uplink rules. |
